Package: xtra
Title: Extra Utility Functions for R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Nour Edin", "Darwish", , "nouredindarwish@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0009-5527-4539"))
Description: A growing collection of extra utility functions for R.
    Current tools include reading Excel files that use multiple header
    rows with merged cells, saving plots to disk, and adding images with
    optional captioning to Word documents.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/NourEdinDarwish/xtra
BugReports: https://github.com/NourEdinDarwish/xtra/issues
